cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SGA, English + Lean"
message: "If you use this translation or the Lean development, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SGAenglishpluslean contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/Dharmavati213/SGAenglishpluslean"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dharmavati213/SGAenglishpluslean"
url: "https://github.com/Dharmavati213/SGAenglishpluslean"
abstract: >
  Unofficial English translations of Grothendieck's Séminaire de
  Géométrie Algébrique du Bois Marie (SGA), together with a Lean 4
  formalization on mathlib. The first text is SGA 1, Exposé VI
  (fibered categories and descent).
keywords:
  - SGA
  - Grothendieck
  - algebraic geometry
  - fibered categories
  - descent
  - Lean 4
  - mathlib
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Revêtements étales et groupe fondamental (SGA 1)"
    authors:
      - family-names: Grothendieck
        given-names: Alexander
      - family-names: Raynaud
        given-names: Michel
    year: 2004
    identifiers:
      - type: other
        value: "arXiv:math/0206203"
        description: SMF recomposition
